OL,3,AGunmen kill at least 10 villagers and
OL,4,Aloot shops in north-east Nigeria
OL,5,
OL,6,FUnknown gunmen have raided a remote
OL,7,Fvillage in the north-eastern Nigerian
OL,8,Fstate of Taraba, killing at least 10
OL,9,Fpeople, looting shops and setting
OL,10,Fhouses ablaze, police say.
OL,12,FThere are fears the actual death toll
OL,13,Fis much higher, with eyewitnesses
OL,14,Fspeaking of 20 lives lost and a
OL,15,Fnon-governmental organisation
OL,16,Fsuggesting a toll of as many as 50.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,319,300,200,140,0,100
