OL,3,AGunmen kill at least 10 villagers and
OL,4,Aloot shops in north-east Nigeria
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe gunmen reportedly swooped on the
OL,7,Fvillage of Binnari in the Karim Lamido
OL,8,Farea mounted on motorcycles just after
OL,9,Fmidday Muslim prayers on Friday in a
OL,10,Frampage that went on for up to four
OL,11,Fhours.
OL,13,FPolice say they are searching for other
OL,14,Fcasualties in the bush but the
OL,15,Fauthorities were accused by Amnesty
OL,16,FInternational of failing to protect
OL,17,Frural communities.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
